SUMMARY:Disney’s The Little Mermaid
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, be part of our world!\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Disney’s The Little Mermaid is a dazzling musical adventure based on the beloved Hans Christian Andersen tale and classic animated film. Featuring unforgettable music by eight-time Academy Award® winner Alan Menken\, with lyrics by Howard Ashman and Glenn Slater\, this Broadway-sized spectacular follows Ariel\, a curious young mermaid who dreams of life above the Sea. Relive all the moments you love with songs like “Under the Sea\,” “Kiss the Girl\,” and “Part of Your World.” This enchanting production created by Theatre Under The Stars is this holiday’s hottest ticket. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				PRODUCTION SPONSOR \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				CRITICAL ACCLAIM FOR THE LITTLE MERMAID\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n					- Houston Chronicle \n					\n					“This intricate and enjoyable production will leave you swimming in a sea of fun and wonder.” \n					\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n					- Broadway World – Houston\n					\n					“This production does your favorite childhood movie justice and then some.”\n					\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n			\n			\n			\n					- Houston Press \n					\n					“What a splendid production … Theatre Under the Stars’ spirited rendition rivals any Broadway house.” \n					\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				PERFORMANCE SCHEDULE\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tuesday\, Dec 8\, 7:30 p.m. — H-E-B Community Night\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Wednesday\, Dec 9\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Thursday\, Dec 10\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Friday\, Dec 11\, 8 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Saturday\, Dec 12\, 2 p.m. (LIMITED AVAILABILITY)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Saturday\, Dec 12\, 8 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Sunday\, Dec 13\, 2 p.m. (LIMITED AVAILABILITY)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Sunday\, Dec 13\, 7:30 p.m. (LIMITED AVAILABILITY)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tuesday\, Dec 15\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Wednesday\, Dec 16\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Thursday\, Dec 17\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Friday\, Dec 18\, 8 p.m. - Post-Show Talkback with the Cast\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Saturday\, Dec 19\, 2 p.m. — Open Captioned  (SEATS GOING FAST)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Saturday\, Dec 19\, 8 p.m\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Sunday\, Dec 20\, 2 p.m. — ASL & Audio Described  (SEATS GOING FAST)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Sunday\, Dec 20\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Tuesday\, Dec 22\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Wednesday\, Dec 23\, 7:30 p.m. \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Thursday\, Dec 24\, 11 a.m. — Special Christmas Eve Early Matinee\n			\n				\n			\n				SUBSCRIBE NOW\n			\n				GET TICKETS!\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				TICKETING INFO\nSeason tickets are available. 6-show packages start at just $34 per-show. \nTickets are $46 and are available online or by calling TUTS Guest Services at 713-558-8887. Tickets will also available in person Monday through Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Office\, located in the Hobby Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are available for parties of 10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of accessibility options for guests.Learn more about accessible performances and other services here. \nRush tickets will be available for $35 at the box office for mezzanine and gallery seating starting 2 hours prior to curtain. \nQuestions about parking\, dining or other aspects of attending a TUTS show? We’ve got answers! \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				RUN TIME\n2 hours and 30 minutes including intermission\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				CONTENT NOTICE\nDisney’s The Little Mermaid is intended for guests 6 and up. All guests require a ticket\, regardless of age. \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Photos\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                            \n                