SUMMARY:2027 Tommy Tune Awards Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:\n					\n						FRIDAY\, MAY 14\, 2027 · 7:00 PM\n						\n					\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n					\n						The hobby center\n						\n					\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n					\n						Info\n						Produced by Theatre Under The Stars\nFeaturing Houston’s top high school musical theatre students.\n					\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				ON SALE SPRING 2027\nSTAY TUNED FOR DETAILS \n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Where Houston’s Future Broadway Legends Shine\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				The Tommy Tune Awards ceremony is the city’s biggest night for high school musical theatre — a high-energy celebration spotlighting the most talented student performers\, designers\, and directors in the region. Join us for the celebration on Friday\, May 14 at the Hobby Center. \nCreated and produced by Theatre Under The Stars\, this electrifying ceremony honors excellence on and off the stage\, with showstopping performances and unforgettable moments inspired by the legacy of Broadway legend and Houston native Tommy Tune. \n  \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				    SPONSORED BY \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Sign up now for advanced access to seats to the 2027 Tommy Tune Awards! \n			\n				Sign Up for Pre-Sale Access\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n					\n				\n			\n				FIND OUT MORE ABOUT THE TOMMY TUNE AWARDS
